<title>INDIA: Yield on Indian 91-day t-bill steady at 6.23 pct.</title>
<headline>Yield on Indian 91-day t-bill steady at 6.23 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said on Friday it maintained the cut-off at 98.47 rupees at its weekly auction of 91-day treasury bills.</p>
<p>Dealers said the yield was unchanged at 6.23 percent. </p>
<p>--</p>
